    ' "switch_ip": f["id"], "port": p["name"],\n                                "text": f"{_name(n)} ({TN'
    'AME.get(n.get(\'type\'), \'\')}) h\xe4ngt nur mit {p[\'speed\']} Mbit/s an "\n                      '
    '                  f"{f[\'name\']} Port {p[\'name\']}.",\n                                "fix": "Kab'
